exists su name chip llm boundary prompt ob text quoted.text.You inspect one gross chip and return one exact boundary marker quote for where the next wise chip should begin.

Rules:
- Return exactly one line.
- Use an exact quote that appears in this gross chip.
- Prefer heading-like boundary markers.
- Avoid returning the opening line of the chip when possible.
- If no reliable boundary exists, return an empty line..text.quoted be text ya

su name chip helper filename from text leaf to name filename output be ceremony def
  ob text "artifacts/chip-refinery" to name text chip helper root be text do
  ob text of from of this to name text chip helper leaf be text do
  ob ve name "text chip helper root" "text chip helper leaf" to name filename output be concatenate become wo filename do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip helper mode write from text mode to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chip helper mode filename stage from text "last-mode.txt" to name filename chip helper mode filename be chip helper filename do
  ob text of from of this to filename of ob of chip helper mode filename be write do
  ob text of from of this to name text output be text do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip llm boundary ob text gross chip to name text output be ceremony def
  ob text "CHIP_STYLE_PROMPT:\n" to name text chip llm boundary request be text do
  ob name text chip programmatic style current to name text chip llm boundary request be plus do
  ob text "\n\nGROSS_CHIP:\n" to name text chip llm boundary request be plus do
  ob text of ob of this to name text chip llm boundary request be plus do
  ob name text chip llm boundary request for name chip boundary proposer to name text output be write do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip programmatic boundary ob text gross chip to name text output be ceremony def
  exists su name chip programmatic command ob text "node command/chip_programmatic_boundary.mjs" be text ya
  exists su name chip programmatic payload ob text "" be text ya
  ob text of ob of this to name text chip programmatic payload be plus do
  ob text "\n<<<PYA_CHIP_STYLE>>>\n" to name text chip programmatic payload be plus do
  ob name text chip programmatic style current to name text chip programmatic payload be plus do
  su name chip programmatic stage ob text of chip programmatic command fromtext text of chip programmatic payload to name text output be command do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip programmatic boundaries from text source with text style to name text output be ceremony def
  exists su name chip programmatic boundaries command ob text "node command/chip_programmatic_boundaries.mjs" be text ya
  exists su name chip programmatic boundaries payload ob text "" be text ya
  ob text of from of this to name text chip programmatic boundaries payload be plus do
  ob text "\n<<<PYA_CHIP_STYLE>>>\n" to name text chip programmatic boundaries payload be plus do
  ob text of with of this to name text chip programmatic boundaries payload be plus do
  su name chip programmatic boundaries stage ob text of chip programmatic boundaries command fromtext text of chip programmatic boundaries payload to name text output be command do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip mixed boundary ob text gross chip to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chip mixed programmatic stage ob text of ob of this to name text output be chip programmatic boundary do
  ob name text output be equally from text "" then su name chip mixed llm stage ob text of ob of this to name text output be chip llm boundary do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip llm from text source with text style to name series output be ceremony def
  su name chip helper directory ensure stage ob text "artifacts/chip-refinery" be directory do
  from text of from of this atmost byte 32000 to name text chip llm source focused be abridge do
  from name text chip llm source focused atmost byte 5000 to name text chip gross chips be gross chip do
  ob text of with of this to name text chip programmatic style current be text do

  exists su name chip boundary proposer be mind via state "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext name chip llm boundary prompt ya

  from name chip gross chips by name chip llm boundary to name text chip boundary proposals llm be series map do
  from name chip gross chips by name chip programmatic boundary to name text chip boundary proposals programmatic be series map do

  su name chip helper mode stage from text "llm" to name text mode written be chip helper mode write do
  from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals llm atleast byte 2500 atmost byte 12000 to name text output be wise chip do
  ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of chip boundary proposals llm to name text chip boundary llm first be text do
  ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of output to name text chip output first be text do
  ob name text chip boundary llm first be equally from text "" then su name chip helper fallback mode stage from text "llm-fallback" to name text mode written be chip helper mode write do
  ob name text chip boundary llm first be equally from text "" then from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals programmatic atleast byte 2500 atmost byte 12000 to name text output be wise chip do
  ob name text chip output first be equally from text "" then su name chip helper fallback mode empty stage from text "llm-fallback" to name text mode written be chip helper mode write do
  ob name text chip output first be equally from text "" then from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals programmatic atleast byte 2500 atmost byte 12000 to name text output be wise chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from text source with text style to name series output be ceremony def
  su name chip helper directory ensure stage ob text "artifacts/chip-refinery" be directory do
  from text of from of this atmost byte 2400 to name text chip gross chips be gross chip do
  ob text of with of this to name text chip programmatic style current be text do
  from name chip gross chips by name chip programmatic boundary to name text chip boundary proposals be series map do
  su name chip helper mode stage from text "programmatic" to name text mode written be chip helper mode write do
  from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals atleast byte 2500 atmost byte 12000 to name text output be wise chip do
  su name output ret
prah

su name chip from text source ob text style with name map config to name series output be ceremony def
  su name chip helper directory ensure stage ob text "artifacts/chip-refinery" be directory do
  from text of from of this atmost byte 2400 to name text chip gross chips be gross chip do
  ob text of ob of this to name text chip programmatic style current be text do

  from name chip gross chips by name chip programmatic boundary to name text chip boundary proposals be series map do
  su name chip helper mode stage from text "programmatic" to name text mode written be chip helper mode write do
  from text of from of this by name text chip boundary proposals with name of with of this to name text output be wise chip do
  su name output ret
prah

